"6vk3gs0ten": "The autopsy, crime-lab and emergency-room records in this file describe in detail where the gunshot wounds were, the inside of the wounds, and the blood inside and outside the cars. There is also a photo of a car interior spattered with blood.",
"264b4onckks": "1969. Night fog on the California coast. Letters with an hourglass drawn on them keep coming to the newsroom.",
"219ecfhnc1j": "**Evidence File 05** · KNOWLTON POLICE DEPT. · Case 68-1214 / 69-0503 · original letters replaced by copies",
