"5hhuxtjspa": "The cipher from the letter that arrived May 6, copied out by the city desk. The plain text is presumed to be English, in capitals.",
"4ezykbtmbx": "It looks like a simple substitution: one symbol for one letter of the alphabet. The same symbol is always the same letter. Periods and the hourglass are left as they are.",
"2ycqbkns9z": "Desk memo: the writer has said himself that his letters always begin with the same sentence. Go back to the first letter.",
"1o5n6hlawxc": "The state crime lab pinned down two symbols for us — ⊞ is M, ♁ is V.",
"10qny4cuvnt": "(Plain reading) The sand runs. I leave your Sundays at your door. You read me and do not see.",
